SUMMARY:Sober (Curious) Monthly Coffee Walk *new location*
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Lose The Booze Crew (20-40s)\nHappy May\, friends!! 
 Come join us for our monthly coffee walk around River Arts District.\n\n**
 We'll be doing 3-4miles and leave promptly at 10:10am. Route will be same 
 as last time\, over Haywood bridge\, then up to former French Broad park\,
  turn around back up to Craven St bridge\, and back to Summit (there is ac
 tive construction where French Broad Park used to be). Arrive on time or g
 et left behind.** 🫣\n\nYou can find plenty of parking on Lyman St\, Cli
 ngman Ave or the gravel lot for Summit Coffee.\n\n**Gentle Reminder:** Thi
 s isn't a 12-step\, recovery group or dating mixer\, just some people hang
 ing out without the booze.\n\nIf your plans change\, please update your RS
 VP status as soon as possible.\n\nWell behaved doggos are welcome but keep
  in mind they won't be allowed inside the coffee shop.\n\nCan't wait to se
 e your beautiful faces 🤗!!
